{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《夫妻的博弈》劇中除了男女主角的角力，飾演富二代「胡哲朗」的孔德賢（Danny）同樣是一大亮點。擁有亮眼外表的他，在劇中處處表現出不甘被家姐 Quinn（陳曉華飾）搶盡風頭的野心，豪門姊弟鬥爭一觸即發！</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a955cbe7-52a3-462c-a770-3307d41f103b.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026OQd0WGnOiB1787207349.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a955cbe7-52a3-462c-a770-3307d41f103b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">講到衍嶸集團與東馹集團舉行合作框架協議簽署儀式，作為東馹集團行政總裁的哲朗，理應是全場記者追訪的唯一焦點。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">豈料「太后」葉卓苓君（黃文慧 飾）竟在現場投下震撼彈，即場公布葉、胡兩家正式結為姻親，宣佈Aiden（馬國明飾）與Quinn將會拉埋天窗！此話一出，瞬間搶去哲朗所有風頭，令本應是主角的他慘成佈景板，心生不忿。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4f03fb38-3ef9-41af-8cfd-799b866b07f0.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026LUO9LU00gF1787207349.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4f03fb38-3ef9-41af-8cfd-799b866b07f0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事後哲朗一臉不爽，向父親胡振東（李成昌 飾）大吐苦水：「啱啱影咗咁多張相，偏偏剩係登咗最後嗰張大合照，個C位畀晒 Aiden 同你個女呀，我就得半邊臉！」他更重提舊帳，直指上次廣告風波被奪權：「我等咗咁耐就係等今日，我依家要做乖仔都要有人睇到先得㗎！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">見到兒子呷晒大醋，胡振東即刻派定心丸，承諾只要他安分守己，必定找大把精英幫他上位接班。哲朗聽到老竇這番保證，隨即上演「一秒變臉」，由極度勞氣瞬間轉為暗喜，自覺勝券在握，盡顯豪門公子有機心的一面！</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cec9d9dd-d43e-4d8a-92c3-d9f6bf3d6901.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Lqs4RHSGOZ1787207349.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cec9d9dd-d43e-4d8a-92c3-d9f6bf3d6901.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">今次繼《新聞女王》後再演富二代，Danny 接受 <a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">tvb.com</a> 獨家訪問時直言演繹上有很大分別：「今次要成熟啲，因為呢個角色唔係遊手好閒嘅富二代，佢係有上進心、渴望得到權力，但偏偏佢又『奸得嚟又好蠢』，好希望可以呈現到呢種感覺畀觀眾睇。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 雖然劇中角色高調又機心重，但Danny自言現實性格反差極大：「現實中嘅我其實好樸素簡單，同埋我從來唔覺得自己特別靚仔。我唔係嚟做偶像，我係做演員，希望觀眾可以睇到我嘅可塑性！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">至於今次與李成昌及陳曉華演一家人，Danny 直言合作得相當愉快：「我同昌哥之前都合作過，大家都好 Friend，佢好好人，真係好似我爸爸咁；而 Hera（陳曉華）我哋識咗好多年，大家私底下都係好朋友，所以拍起上嚟默契十足！」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f56ff313-70c3-4322-83d1-9697206b9589.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026HTZGERVPka1787207349.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f56ff313-70c3-4322-83d1-9697206b9589.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T07:19:03.988948+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":809,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}